      <h2 id="lead-system-title">The gap is usually between the enquiry and the reply.</h2>
      <p>
        More traffic will not fix a slow response, a vague page or a lead that disappears into an inbox. We connect the parts that turn interest into a sales conversation.
      </p>
    </header>

    <ol class="lead-system__flow" aria-label="Lead conversion process" data-lead-flow>
      <li class="lead-system__step">
        <span class="lead-system__number">01</span>
        <div>
          <span class="lead-system__label">Get found</span>
          <h3>Reach people already looking</h3>
          <p>Google Ads, Meta Ads, local SEO and useful content bring the right attention to the business.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="lead-system__step">
        <span class="lead-system__number">02</span>
        <div>
